        "  - Run 'Firefox Nightly Profile Manager', choose 'Scoop-Nightly' then click 'Start Nightly'.",
        "  - Visit 'about:profiles' page in Firefox Nightly to check *DEFAULT* profile.",
        "For details: https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/profile-manager-create-remove-switch-firefox-profiles"
    ],
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://archive.mozilla.org/pub/firefox/nightly/2026/08/2026-08-25-09-04-28-mozilla-central/firefox-156.0a1.en-US.win64.installer.exe#/dl.7z",
            "hash": "sha512:554f38302bfeadd8939e1e8ecf2ad136cffeb5bd2c478a414ffcb5ac354ea97110a1ff00a63a1fda0cfe03b524e6f29ea8ef316102df1d0d6ddb3e8a56339d43"
        },
        "32bit": {
            "url": "https://archive.mozilla.org/pub/firefox/nightly/2026/08/2026-08-25-09-04-28-mozilla-central/firefox-156.0a1.en-US.win32.installer.exe#/dl.7z",
